  render_table_row_4(tbl, "Z/12,612,600", "341,250 = 7*48,750", "7", "13-channel class count = (13+1)/2 = 7.");
  render_p(sec, "Level 4 is special: classes = phi = 48. Seeing and acting coincide. The 13-channel class contribution: (13+1)/2 = 7. The depth prime IS the boundary's spectral weight. Per-channel: d(2^3)=5, d(3^2)=5, d(5^2)=13, d(7^2)=25, d(11)=6, d(13)=7. Product for Z/12,612,600: 5*5*13*25*6*7 = 341,250.");
