  render_p(sec, "11 breaks balance from 1 to 5/3 = Kolmogorov. 13 scales by 12/7 = heartbeat/depth. Z/210 is the last ring where seeing = acting. After that, the universe experiences asymmetry as turbulence. The minimum channel count theorem proves 5 channels necessary and sufficient at Z/2,310 level. The 6th channel (13) wraps the organism: 970,200*13 = 12,612,600 = Z/12,612,600.");
